OL,3,AJob vacancies fall as small firms cut
OL,4,Aback on recruitment
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe ONS figures also showed the
OL,7,Funemployment rate fell to 4.7% in the
OL,8,Fthree months to August, the lowest for
OL,9,Fmore than a year.
